---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { links, strava } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="About" description="Who Vinith Sudhir is outside work: running, riding, training and more.">
  <section class="wrap intro">
    <h1>About me</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      I'm Vinith. I live in Bengaluru, back home after six years in the US: two in New Jersey for my master's and
      then Seattle. Outside work I spend most of my time running, riding and training.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap sections">
    <section>
      <h2>Training for</h2>
      <p>
        An Ironman 70.3 in 2027. Running is where I started: I trained for the Eugene Marathon and I race 50K trail
        ultras. Swimming is my weak leg, so for now that means a lot of laps in the pool.
      </p>
      {strava && <p>Every run and ride goes up on <a href={strava}>Strava</a>.</p>}
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Curious about</h2>
      <p>
        Economics, mostly at the level of systems: food security policy, land value tax, how the EV market works, and
        what AI does to labour. I'm also a big fan of <cite>Jet Lag: The Game</cite>. In Seattle I designed my own
        hide-and-seek game around Sound Transit, with house rules.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Food</h2>
      <p>
        I cook plant-based and high-protein, and I keep it clean and simple. My usual order is an oat matcha latte.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Languages</h2>
      <p>Kannada is my first language. I work in English and get by in Hindi.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Say hello</h2>
      <ul class="elsewhere">
        {links.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a></li>)}
      </ul>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro {
    padding-block: 3rem 2rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.04;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.3125rem;
    color: var(--mist);
    max-width: 36rem;
  }

  .sections section {
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .sections h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .sections .elsewhere {
    font-family: var(--sans);
  }
</style>
